            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esaziphendulela ngokunjalo, uFestusi wathi ngelizwi elikhulu: Pawuli, uyahlanya, ukufunda okunengi kuyakuhlanyisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uPawuli wathi: Kangihlanyi, mhlekazi Festusi, kodwa ngikhuluma amazwi aliqiniso eliqondileyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi iyazi ngalezizinto, ngakho ngikhuluma layo ngesibindi; ngoba ngikholwa ukuthi kalukho lalunye lwalezizinto olufihlakeleyo kuyo; ngoba lokhu kakwenziwanga engosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkosi Agripha, uyakholwa abaprofethi na? Ngiyazi ukuthi uyakholwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UAgripha wathi kuPawuli: Uthi ngokufitshane nje usuzangenza ngibe ngumKristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UPawuli wasesithi: Bengingafisa kuNkulunkulu ukuba, loba ngokufitshane loba ngokude, kungabi nguwe wedwa kodwa bonke abangizwayo lamuhla babe njengami, ngaphandle kwalezizibopho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.26.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
